# Research captures taken from the *authenticated* Linear app.
#
# The visual-research lane found the browser already signed in to a real
# workspace, so the highest-fidelity references it collected are screenshots and
# DOM dumps of live company issues — team names, issue titles, member avatars.
# They are the best reference material in the project and the one thing that
# must not be pushed: this repository is public. The design tokens and geometry
# measured from them live on in `research/01-visual-design.md`, which is the
# part that was worth keeping anyway.
research/screenshots/linear-app-*
research/screenshots/app-*.json

